  "content": "<div class=\"html-chunk\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><b><strong>Tree Data Structure</strong></b><span> is a non-linear data structure&nbsp;in which a collection of elements known as nodes are connected to each other via edges such that there exists exactly one path between any two nodes.</span></p><figure class=\"image\"><img alt=\"root\" height=\"400\" src=\"/images/dsa-558-img-1.webp\" srcset=\"https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250705194019442821/root.webp 800w,https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250705194019442821/root-100.webp 100w,https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250705194019442821/root-200.webp 200w,https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250705194019442821/root-300.webp 300w,https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250705194019442821/root-660.webp 660w,https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250705194019442821/root-768.webp 768w\" width=\"800\"><figcaption> </figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"types-of-tree\" style=\"text-align:left\"><span>Basics </span></h2><ul><li value=\"1\"><a href=\"/#/article/dsa/dsa-346\" rel=\"noopener\"><span>Introduction </span></a></li><li value=\"2\"><a href=\"https://www.geeksforgeeks.org/dsa/types-of-trees-in-data-structures/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Types </span></a></li><li value=\"3\"><a href=\"https://www.geeksforgeeks.org/dsa/applications-of-tree-data-structure/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Applications </span></a></li></ul><h2 id=\"binary-tree\" style=\"text-align:left\"><b><strong>Binary Tree</strong></b></h2><ol><li value=\"1\"><a href=\"https://www.geeksforgeeks.org/dsa/introduction-to-binary-tree/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Introduction</span></a></li><li value=\"2\"><a href=\"https://www.geeksforgeeks.org/dsa/applications-advantages-and-disadvantages-of-binary-tree/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Applications </span></a></li><li value=\"3\"><a href=\"https://www.geeksforgeeks.org/dsa/properties-of-binary-tree/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Properties of Binary Tree</span></a></li><li value=\"4\"><a href=\"https://www.geeksforgeeks.org/dsa/types-of-binary-tree/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Tyes of Binary Tree</span></a></li><li value=\"5\"><a href=\"/#/article/dsa/dsa-347\" rel=\"noopener\"><span>Inorder Traversal</span></a></li><li value=\"6\"><a href=\"/#/article/dsa/dsa-348\" rel=\"noopener\"><span>Preorder Traversal</span></a></li><li value=\"7\"><a href=\"/#/article/dsa/dsa-349\" rel=\"noopener\"><span>Postorder Traversal</span></a></li><li value=\"8\"><a href=\"/#/article/dsa/dsa-350\" rel=\"noopener\"><span>Level Order Tree Traversal</span></a></li><li value=\"9\"><a href=\"/#/article/dsa/dsa-352\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Height or Depth </span></a></li><li value=\"10\"><a href=\"https://www.geeksforgeeks.org/dsa/get-level-of-a-node-in-a-binary-tree/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Level of a Given Node in Tree</span></a></li><li value=\"11\"><a href=\"https://www.geeksforgeeks.org/dsa/search-a-node-in-binary-tree/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Search a Node </span></a></li><li value=\"12\"><a href=\"https://www.geeksforgeeks.org/dsa/find-the-parent-of-a-node-in-the-given-binary-tree/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Find the Parent</span></a></li><li value=\"13\"><a href=\"https://www.geeksforgeeks.org/dsa/insertion-in-a-binary-tree-in-level-order/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Insertion</span></a></li><li value=\"14\"><a href=\"https://www.geeksforgeeks.org/dsa/deletion-binary-tree/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Deletion </span></a></li><li value=\"15\"><a href=\"https://www.geeksforgeeks.org/dsa/enumeration-of-binary-trees/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Enumeration of Binary Trees</span></a></li><li value=\"16\"><a href=\"https://www.geeksforgeeks.org/dsa/print-leaf-nodes-left-right-binary-tree/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Find all Leaf nodes</span></a></li><li value=\"17\"><a href=\"https://www.geeksforgeeks.org/dsa/binary-tree-array-implementation/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Array Implementation</span></a></li></ol><h2 id=\"binary-search-tree\" style=\"text-align:left\"><b><strong>Binary Search Tree</strong></b></h2><ol><li value=\"1\"><a href=\"/#/article/dsa/dsa-386\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Introduction</span></a></li><li value=\"2\"><a href=\"https://www.geeksforgeeks.org/dsa/applications-of-bst/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Applications</span></a><span> </span></li><li value=\"3\"><a href=\"/#/article/dsa/dsa-387\" rel=\"noopener\"><span>Searching </span></a></li><li value=\"4\"><a href=\"/#/article/dsa/dsa-388\" rel=\"noopener\"><span>Insertion</span></a><span> </span></li><li value=\"5\"><a href=\"https://www.geeksforgeeks.org/dsa/binary-search-tree-traversal-inorder-preorder-post-order/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Traversals – Inorder, Preorder, Post Order</span></a></li><li value=\"6\"><a href=\"/#/article/dsa/dsa-389\" rel=\"noopener\"><span>Deletion </span></a></li><li value=\"7\"><a href=\"https://www.geeksforgeeks.org/dsa/binary-search-tree-data-structure/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>More Problems on Binary Search Tree</span></a></li></ol><h2 id=\"avl-tree\" style=\"text-align:left\"><b><strong>AVL Tree</strong></b></h2><ol><li value=\"1\"><a href=\"https://www.geeksforgeeks.org/dsa/introduction-to-avl-tree/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>AVL Tree Data Structure</span></a><span> </span></li><li value=\"2\"><a href=\"https://www.geeksforgeeks.org/dsa/insertion-in-an-avl-tree/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Insertion</span></a></li><li value=\"3\"><a href=\"https://www.geeksforgeeks.org/dsa/deletion-in-an-avl-tree/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Deletion </span></a></li><li value=\"4\"><a href=\"https://www.geeksforgeeks.org/dsa/weak-avl-or-rank-balanced-trees/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Weak AVL or Rank Balanced Trees</span></a><span> </span></li><li value=\"5\"><a href=\"https://www.geeksforgeeks.org/dsa/avl-with-duplicate-keys/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>AVL with duplicate keys</span></a></li><li value=\"6\"><a href=\"https://www.geeksforgeeks.org/dsa/count-greater-nodes-in-avl-tree/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Count greater nodes in AVL tree</span></a></li><li value=\"7\"><a href=\"https://www.geeksforgeeks.org/dsa/how-to-insert-strings-into-an-avl-tree/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>How to insert Strings into an AVL Tree</span></a></li><li value=\"8\"><a href=\"https://www.geeksforgeeks.org/dsa/minimum-number-of-nodes-in-an-avl-tree-with-given-height/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Minimum nodes in an AVL Tree with given height</span></a></li><li value=\"9\"><a href=\"https://www.geeksforgeeks.org/dsa/optimal-sequence-for-avl-tree-insertion-without-any-rotations/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Optimal sequence for AVL tree insertion</span></a></li><li value=\"10\"><a href=\"https://www.geeksforgeeks.org/dsa/different-shapes-of-avl-possible-at-height-h/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Different shapes of AVL possible at height h</span></a></li></ol><h2 id=\"redblack-tree\" style=\"text-align:left\"><b><strong>Red-Black Tree</strong></b></h2><ol><li value=\"1\"><a href=\"/#/article/dsa/dsa-567\" rel=\"noopener\"><span>Introduction to Red-Black Tree</span></a><span> </span></li><li value=\"2\"><a href=\"https://www.geeksforgeeks.org/dsa/insertion-in-red-black-tree/\" rel=\"