eksforgeeks.org/dsa/depth-n-ary-tree/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Depth of an N-ary Tree</span></a></li><li value=\"3\"><a href=\"https://www.geeksforgeeks.org/dsa/number-children-given-node-n-ary-tree/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Children of a Node in an N-ary Tree</span></a><span> </span></li><li value=\"4\"><a href=\"https://www.geeksforgeeks.org/dsa/print-siblings-of-given-node-in-an-n-ary-tree/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Find Siblings in an N-ary Tree</span></a></li><li value=\"5\"><a href=\"https://www.geeksforgeeks.org/dsa/mirror-of-n-ary-tree/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Mirror of n-ary Tree</span></a></li><li value=\"6\"><a href=\"https://www.geeksforgeeks.org/dsa/diameter-n-ary-tree/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Diameter of an N-ary Tree</span></a></li><li value=\"7\"><a href=\"https://www.geeksforgeeks.org/dsa/level-order-traversal-of-n-ary-tree/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Level Order Traversal of N-ary Tree</span></a></li><li value=\"8\"><a href=\"https://www.geeksforgeeks.org/dsa/sum-elements-n-ary-tree/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Sum of all elements of N-ary Tree</span></a></li><li value=\"9\"><a href=\"https://www.geeksforgeeks.org/dsa/serialize-deserialize-n-ary-tree/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Serialize and Deserialize an N-ary Tree</span></a></li></ol><h2 id=\"b-tree-1\" style=\"text-align:left\"><b><strong>B Tree</strong></b></h2><ol><li value=\"1\"><a href=\"https://www.geeksforgeeks.org/dsa/introduction-of-b-tree-2/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Introduction of B-Tree</span></a><span> </span></li><li value=\"2\"><a href=\"https://www.geeksforgeeks.org/dsa/insert-operation-in-b-tree/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Insert Operation in B-Tree</span></a></li><li value=\"3\"><a href=\"https://www.